    //! - Converted the struct names to PascalCase.
    //! - Renamed `mod` → `modulus`.
    //! - Moduli are `u32`, not `i32`.
    //! - `Id`s are `usize`, not `i32`.
    //! - The default `Id` is `0`, not `-1`.
    //! - The type of the argument of `pow` is `u64`, not `i64`.
